        }
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso, right margin",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>I send you my best regards.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Ab\u016b l-Khayr kisses</li>\n<li>your hand and</li>\n<li>sends greetings to</li>\n<li>Ab\u016b Sa<sup>\u02bf</sup>d, Zak\u012b,</li>\n<li>and his close friend Y\u016bsuf.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>By God,</li>\n<li>[do not delay].</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
